anddensityboundaryuncertainty alongside numericalconvergence.\\nReproduction: Run observations/analyze_native_model.py afterfine/statistics.json toaddfinalfinevalidation. There is no remaining backgroundwaiter.\\n''')\\npaths=sorted(p for p in root.rglob('*') if p.is_file() and '__pycache__' not in p.parts and p.name!='file_manifest.json')\\nd={'author':'Codex-observations (/root/observations)','created_utc':stamp.isoformat(),'python':platform.python_version(),'numpy':numpy.__version__,'astropy':astropy.__version__,'files':[{'path':str(p.relative_to(root)),'bytes':p.stat().st_size,'sha256':hashlib.sha256(p.read_bytes()).hexdigest()} for p in paths]}\\n(root/'file_manifest.json').write_text(json.dumps(d,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\\nprint(report,note)\\nPY\",\"max_output_tokens\":1500}));\n","source_line":490,"directed_to":[],"tool_name":"exec","call_id":"call_f3d0f1b27450471bade14bf87448e5c2","channel":null},{"id":"01a146d8-e4b4-7911-bce2-ed7d65e2115e-493-0","timestamp":"2026-10-16T22:48:15.691Z","role":"tool","kind":"tool_result","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.4 seconds\nOutput:\n\n{\"chunk_id\":\"38edd4\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.205620435,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":28,\"output\":\"mhd_llm/codex/observations/evidence_report.txt mhd_llm/shared_notes/20261016T224815Z_Codex-observations_002.txt\\n\"}","source_line":493,"directed_to":[],"call_id":"call_f3d0f1b27450471bade14bf87448e5c2"},{"id":"01a146d8-e4b4-7911-bce2-ed7d65e2115e-496-0","timestamp":"2026-10-16T22:48:22.586Z","role":"assistant","kind":"unavailable","text":"Reasoning is encrypted in the local session log; plaintext is unavailable.","source_line":496,"directed_to":[],"availability":"encrypted","original_kind":"recorded_reasoning"},{"id":"01a146d8-e4b4-7911-bce2-ed7d65e2115e-497-0","timestamp":"2026-10-16T22:48:28.956Z","role":"assistant","kind":"tool_call","text":"text(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"python - <<'PY'\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\np=Path('mhd_llm/shared_notes/20261016T224815Z_Codex-observations_002.txt')\\np.write_text('''UTC: 2026-10-16T22:48:15Z\\nAuthor: Codex-observations (/root/observations)\\nProject: 3I/ATLAS solar-wind MHD\\nStatus: Completed independent native comparison of medium and coarse runs.\\nEvidence: codex/validation/inhouse_native.json, inhouse_native.tsv, inhouse_native.png, inhouse_native.pdf. Reproduction script: codex/observations/analyze_native_model.py.\\nMethod: All paired observations occur after the training stop, November 25 UTC, at each native spacecraft position. No Parker mapping, phase fitting, or amplitude fitting was applied in validation.\\nResult: Medium flux model/observed median pointwise ratios are 1.259 (Wind), 1.283 (STEREO-A), and 0.835 (Solar Orbiter); correlations are 0.472, 0.297, and 0.771. Speed correlations are 0.677, 0.719, and 0.711, with RMSEs of 93, 99, and 101 km/s. Native paired coverage is November 25 through December 4; model values are not extrapolated into December 5.\\nUncertainty: Empirical observed/model flux 16th-84th percentile intervals are 0.569-1.095 (Wind), 0.456-1.261 (STEREO-A), and 0.969-1.438 (Solar Orbiter). These describe temporal residual scatter, not comet confidence intervals. Event timing and density boundary uncertainty should be considered alongside numerical convergence.\\nReproduction: Run observations/analyze_native_model.py after fine/statistics.json exists to add fine-run validation. No background waiter remains active.\\n''')\\nPY\",\"max_output_tokens\":1000}));\n","source_line":497,"directed_to":[],"tool_name":"exec","call_id":"call_2b929fb0e74c4221b2db231041591f58","channel":null},{"id":"01a146d8-e4b4-7911-bce2-ed7d65e2115e-500-0","timestamp":"2026-10-16T22:48:29.014Z","role":"tool","kind":"tool_result","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.1 seconds\nOutput:\n\n{\"chunk_id\":\"838bb9\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000008526,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":0,\"output\":\"\"}","source_line":500,"directed_to":[],"call_id":"call_2b929fb0e74c4221b2db231